{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/4fe8a2a09c805a0db23cd40c1a72521a.poster.avif?t=1772191187\" width=900 height=531 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/4fe8a2a09c805a0db23cd40c1a72521a.webm?t=1772191187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, you\u2019ve gone and bought the latest model of gaming PC. Or maybe you\u2019ve built a machine yourself, from the ground up. You\u2019ve taken all the factors into consideration; cooling, graphics, computational power, energy consumption. There\u2019s one last question to answer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How do you know you\u2019re really getting the best possible experience for all the effort you\u2019ve put in?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Evolve</i> is a comprehensive benchmarking software designed by experienced game developers. Their industry-insider knowledge is put to use to trace out the exact limits of your hardware through 7 key metrics and help you find room for further optimizations and improvements to performance and power-efficiency. <i>Evolve </i>is consistent and repeatable, but is also continuously updated as both hardware and software go through generational revolutions. The software allows you to compare your runs to other PCs around the world and connects you to a vibrant community full of tips, tricks, and encouragement!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STUNNING GRAPHICAL DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/aa4a7ea20425c0dbe578579779762e9a.poster.avif?t=1772191187\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/aa4a7ea20425c0dbe578579779762e9a.webm?t=1772191187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/aa4a7ea20425c0dbe578579779762e9a.mp4?t=1772191187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reward for your work fine-tuning your machine is a trip through a mysterious cretaceous jungle, complete with foliage and dinosaurs! Every optimization you perform brings this window into the past more and more to life, and helps you understand better and better what your computer is doing and how to improve it.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HALL OF FAME: SEE HOW YOUR MACHINE COMPARES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/1d2f93c206479bce268ac43b3d84c9c7.poster.avif?t=1772191187\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/1d2f93c206479bce268ac43b3d84c9c7.webm?t=1772191187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/1d2f93c206479bce268ac43b3d84c9c7.mp4?t=1772191187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve run through <i>Evolve</i> a few times on your own, doing your best to optimize your PC, you can take a shot at the \u201cHall of Fame\u201d on the <i>Evolve</i> website, submitting an official technical run to see what you\u2019ve accomplished, and maybe see where your machine still has room to improve. <strong>Join a large, vibrant community of builders, gamers and overclockers</strong> to share and gather tips and tricks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEVEN KEY SCORES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/21790f35a1b14a3b8437145dda08194f.avif?t=1772191187\" width=1600 height=930 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/814d0c08437a473248f2a59803b86442.avif?t=1772191187\" width=1600 height=930 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/95ef66c8e7e76a27165db06884abdb36.avif?t=1772191187\" width=1600 height=930 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/6885a33692848850685c2b339b163c59.avif?t=1772191187\" width=1600 height=930 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/a7ecd8cebaef6c6d29447800a9507ae4.avif?t=1772191187\" width=1600 height=930 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/8849e29e9587ede5fbd60e52e7315bad.avif?t=1772191187\" width=1600 height=930 /></span><br><strong>CHOOSE OUR EDITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try Evolve with the Ray Tracer Inline benchmark and 6 scores: Rasterization, Raytracing, Acceleration Structure Build, Compute, Driver, and Energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all 5 benchmarks \u2014 Ray Tracer Inline, Ray Tracer Pipeline, Path Tracer Inline, Path Tracer Pipeline, and Path Tracer Workgraphs \u2014 with 7 scores including Workgraph. Includes Photo mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the Base Version, plus command-line automation, data exports, offline mode, and benchmark looping.<strong></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2717790?t=1772191187","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772191187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/72fdde64105f7450855e478e2af354863838a957/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772191187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/72fdde64105f7450855e478e2af354863838a957/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772191187","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3970150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/4fe8a2a09c805a0db23cd40c1a72521a.poster.avif?t=1772191187\" width=900 height=531 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/4fe8a2a09c805a0db23cd40c1a72521a.webm?t=1772191187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, you\u2019ve gone and bought the latest model of gaming PC. Or maybe you\u2019ve built a machine yourself, from the ground up. You\u2019ve taken all the factors into consideration; cooling, graphics, computational power, energy consumption. There\u2019s one last question to answer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How do you know you\u2019re really getting the best possible experience for all the effort you\u2019ve put in?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Evolve</i> is a comprehensive benchmarking software designed by experienced game developers. Their industry-insider knowledge is put to use to trace out the exact limits of your hardware through 7 key metrics and help you find room for further optimizations and improvements to performance and power-efficiency. <i>Evolve </i>is consistent and repeatable, but is also continuously updated as both hardware and software go through generational revolutions. The software allows you to compare your runs to other PCs around the world and connects you to a vibrant community full of tips, tricks, and encouragement!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STUNNING GRAPHICAL DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/aa4a7ea20425c0dbe578579779762e9a.poster.avif?t=1772191187\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/aa4a7ea20425c0dbe578579779762e9a.webm?t=1772191187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/aa4a7ea20425c0dbe578579779762e9a.mp4?t=1772191187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reward for your work fine-tuning your machine is a trip through a mysterious cretaceous jungle, complete with foliage and dinosaurs! Every optimization you perform brings this window into the past more and more to life, and helps you understand better and better what your computer is doing and how to improve it.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HALL OF FAME: SEE HOW YOUR MACHINE COMPARES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/1d2f93c206479bce268ac43b3d84c9c7.poster.avif?t=1772191187\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/1d2f93c206479bce268ac43b3d84c9c7.webm?t=1772191187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/1d2f93c206479bce268ac43b3d84c9c7.mp4?t=1772191187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve run through <i>Evolve</i> a few times on your own, doing your best to optimize your PC, you can take a shot at the \u201cHall of Fame\u201d on the <i>Evolve</i> website, submitting an official technical run to see what you\u2019ve accomplished, and maybe see where your machine still has room to improve. <strong>Join a large, vibrant community of builders, gamers and overclockers</strong> to share and gather tips and tricks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEVEN KEY SCORES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/21790f35a1b14a3b8437145dda08194f.avif?t=1772191187\" width=1600 height=930 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/814d0c08437a473248f2a59803b86442.avif?t=1772191187\" width=1600 height=930 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/95ef66c8e7e76a27165db06884abdb36.avif?t=1772191187\" width=1600 height=930 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/6885a33692848850685c2b339b163c59.avif?t=1772191187\" width=1600 height=930 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/a7ecd8cebaef6c6d29447800a9507ae4.avif?t=1772191187\" width=1600 height=930 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/8849e29e9587ede5fbd60e52e7315bad.avif?t=1772191187\" width=1600 height=930 /></span><br><strong>CHOOSE OUR EDITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try Evolve with the Ray Tracer Inline benchmark and 6 scores: Rasterization, Raytracing, Acceleration Structure Build, Compute, Driver, and Energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all 5 benchmarks \u2014 Ray Tracer Inline, Ray Tracer Pipeline, Path Tracer Inline, Path Tracer Pipeline, and Path Tracer Workgraphs \u2014 with 7 scores including Workgraph. Includes Photo mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the Base Version, plus command-line automation, data exports, offline mode, and benchmark looping.<strong></strong></p>","developers":["Traverse Research"],"dlc":[3380550],"ext_user_account_notice":"Evolve Account ","genres":[{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/a124908c6ba8c361c0ab3ea530dbaa01d7b97b2c/header.jpg?t=1772191187","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 Traverse Research BV.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<stro